1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Checking screenshots in CI.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:08,500
This is the GitHub Actions setup
from the docs.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:14,500
It installs shotfleet and runs check.
check only needs a Mac, no simulator.

4
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:19,500
--json writes the result as JSON.
The exit code here is 0.

5
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:25,200
0 means all good, 1 means problems,
2 means a setup error.

6
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:27,200
Ready for CI.
